 | DELETE | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | → 204 |
+| DELETE | `/orgs/{oid}/users/{uid}` | offboarding → 204 |
+
+`DELETE /orgs/{oid}/users/{uid}` removes the user from every project of the org
+(archived ones included) and unassigns their tasks. Only an org admin of that org
+may call it (other org → 404, non-admin → 403, target not in the org → 404). The
+user record itself is kept.
 
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
